## 1. General Rules

| Rule | Value |
|---|---|
| Billing Cycle | Monthly |
| Currency | PKR (Pakistani Rupees) |
| Rounding | Round to nearest whole PKR (no paisa) |
| Bill Date | 1st of each month |
| Due Date | 15th of each month (or as configured) |
| Surcharge Rate | 10% of TotalBill (applied only after Due Date) |

---

## 2. Database Tables

### Table: `MaintenanceTariff`
This is the **source of truth** for all maintenance charges.  
The system must ALWAYS read charges from this table — never hardcode amounts.

| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `Project` | string | Project name the property belongs to |
| `Category` | string | Property category (e.g. Residential, Commercial) |
| `Size` | number | Property size in square yards |
| `Charges` | number (PKR) | Maintenance charge for this combination |
| `Tax` | number (PKR) | Tax amount for this combination |

### Table: `Properties`
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `property_id` | unique id | Unique property identifier |
| `owner_name` | string | Owner name |
| `project` | string | Must match `MaintenanceTariff.Project` |
| `category` | string | Must match `MaintenanceTariff.Category` |
| `size` | number | Must match `MaintenanceTariff.Size` |
| `is_active` | boolean | Only active properties are billed |

