## 6. Maintenance Bill — Worked Example

| Step | Field | Calculation | Value |
|---|---|---|---|
| Lookup | Project | — | DHA |
| Lookup | Category | — | Residential |
| Lookup | Size | — | 3,000 sq yards |
| Fetched | BillAmount (Charges) | from DB | PKR 5,250 |
| Fetched | TaxAmount (Tax) | from DB | PKR 336 |
| Step 3 | TotalBill | 5,250 + 336 | **PKR 5,586** |
| Step 4 | Surcharge | 5,586 × 10 / 100 | **PKR 558.6 → PKR 559** |
| Step 5 | BillInDueDate | TotalBill | **PKR 5,586** |
| Step 5 | BillAfterDate | 5,586 + 559 | **PKR 6,145** |

