## 7. Maintenance Bill — Edge Cases & Validations

| Scenario | Expected Behavior |
|---|---|
| Tariff row not found in DB | ❌ Reject — log "Tariff not found", skip |
| Duplicate tariff rows in DB | ❌ Reject — log "Duplicate tariff", alert admin |
| `Charges` is 0 or null | ❌ Reject — invalid tariff |
| `Tax` is null | ❌ Reject — tax must be defined |
| `is_active = false` | ⏭️ Skip — do not generate bill |
| Bill already exists for this month | ❌ Reject — duplicate bill prevention |
| TotalBill = 0 | ⚠️ Warn — log suspicious, admin override required |
| Payment on Due Date | ✅ Charge BillInDueDate (no surcharge) |
| Payment after Due Date | ✅ Charge BillAfterDate (with surcharge) |

---

## 8. Bill Generation Flow

```
START
  │
  ▼
Get all active properties (is_active = true)
  │
  ▼
For each property:
  │
  ├─► Check: Bill already exists for this month?
  │         YES → Skip, log duplicate warning
  │         NO  → Continue
  │
  ├─► Lookup MaintenanceTariff
  │   WHERE Project  = property.project
  │     AND Category = property.category
  │     AND Size     = property.size
  │
  ├─► Lookup successful?
  │         NO  → Skip, log "Tariff not found"
  │         YES → Continue
  │
  ├─► Map: BillAmount = Charges, TaxAmount = Tax
  │
  ├─► Validate: BillAmount > 0 AND TaxAmount is not null
  │         FAIL → Skip, log error
  │         PASS → Continue
  │
  ├─► TotalBill     = BillAmount + TaxAmount
  ├─► Surcharge     = TotalBill * 10 / 100
  ├─► BillInDueDate = TotalBill
  ├─► BillAfterDate = TotalBill + Surcharge
  │
  ├─► Save Bill record (status = "unpaid")
  │
  └─► Log: Bill generated successfully
  │
END
```

